01_Manual Testing

#Overview

This folder contains the manual testing documentation and test artifacts for the **OpenCart E-commerce Project**.

#Activities

* Requirement Analysis
* Test Planning
* Test Scenario & Test Case Design
* RTM Preparation
* Test Execution
* Defect Reporting
* Retesting & Regression Testing

#Deliverables

* FRS
* Test Plan
* Test Scenarios & Test Cases
* RTM
* Test Execution Report
* Bug Report

#Tools

* Microsoft Excel
* Web Browser

02_Agile & Jira

#Overview

This folder contains the **Agile and Jira project management activities** performed for the OpenCart QA Project.

#Agile Approach

The project follows an **Agile/Scrum approach** with work organized into epics, user stories, tasks, and sprints.

#Jira Activities

* Backlog Management
* Epic & User Story Creation
* Sprint Planning
* Task Management
* Priority Management
* Defect Tracking
* Test Management using Zephyr
* Progress Reporting

#Deliverables

* Jira Backlog
* Jira Work Item List
* Jira Project Summary
* Sprint Planning & Tracking

#Tools

* Jira
* Zephyr Essential



